# YJK/OS

WIP Rust port of the (YJK/OS)[https://github.com/inseo-oh/yjk-os].

## Build

Building requires Rust nightly with the `rust-src` component, plus the project toolchain and support files in the sibling `../yjkos/` directory. (Toolchain must be built already)

```sh
./build.sh
```

The bootable ISO is written to `out/i586/YJKOS_i586.iso`.

## Run

With QEMU installed:

```sh
./run.sh
```

Set `YJK_NO_KVM=1` to run QEMU without KVM acceleration.

